Minimal fail-to-pass extraction for openhwgroup/cve2 PR 118, "add
fetch_enable_i".

The reduced controller models the RESET to BOOT_SET transition from the real
diff.  The buggy controller leaves RESET immediately after reset deassertion.
The patch gates that transition on `fetch_enable_i`, matching the PR.  The
Verilator testbench holds `fetch_enable_i` low after reset, then asserts it and
checks that instruction fetch only starts after the enable is observed.

